OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FInitial low cloud and any hill
OL,6,Ffog will soon lift to leave a fine
OL,7,Fmorning and early afternoon with some
OL,8,Fsunshine. However, cloud thickening
OL,9,Ffrom the west through the afternoon.
OL,10,FPatchy rain arriving later. Breezy,
OL,11,Fbut feeling warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud will thicken from the
OL,14,Fnorthwest this evening, heralding a
OL,15,Frather wet night to come with some
OL,16,Fheavy bursts of rain developing at
OL,17,Ftimes. Staying quite warm and humid
OL,18,Ftoo.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,167,160,301,260,100,100
