OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FThe overnight rain will clear
OL,6,Faway to the south on Friday morning,
OL,7,Fleaving a generally dry and bright,
OL,8,Fthough fresher feeling day. Still
OL,9,Fpleasantly warm in the sunshine,
OL,10,Falthough breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAnother
OL,13,Fmostly fine day is expected on
OL,14,FSaturday with some sunshine. Turning
OL,15,Fwindy on Sunday with rain arriving
OL,16,Flater, this clearing by Monday to
OL,17,Fleave a day of sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
